  "content": "<div align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KQNWf12.png\" />\n    <br><br>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/載入器-Forge%20%7C%20Fabric-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/版本-1.20.1-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <br>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Architectury%20API-必備-ecebe6?labelColor=fc7200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/伺服器端-必備-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/客戶端-必備-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/AKMkECwnqf\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973266096763318303?color=7289DA&label=Discord&logo=Discord&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"6\"><b>升級並更強力戰鬥！</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MdjA2H2.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>功能特色</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"><b>雙持武器</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">雙持武器時，經驗值將正確應用於玩家使用的對應武器。</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>為什麼我應該使用這個模組？</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">雖然 Weapon Leveling 本身可以與 Better Combat 搭配運作，但你可能希望同時使用這個擴充模組來升級副手武器。這是 Weapon Leveling 舊版本中的功能，所以如果你使用的是 3.0.0 以下的版本，則不需要此模組。</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">將其拆分為獨立模組的決定，是為了讓未來更新更快速且更簡化。</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">這是 Weapon Leveling 的官方擴充模組</font>\n    <br>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/weapon-leveling\">\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Uxu46dk.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n    </a>\n    <br>\n \n</div>\n\n<br>\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>擴充模組資訊</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\" >此擴充模組由 Weapon Leveling 的創作者 GekidoLukas 製作。所有與此擴充模組相關的問題請回報至<a href=\"https://github.com/GekidoLukas/wl_bc_compat/issues\">此模組的問題頁面</a>。若要請求其他相容性擴充模組，可透過<a href=\"https://github.com/GekidoLukas/weaponleveling/issues\">Weapon Leveling 的問題頁面</a>提出。</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>",
